{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121642","id":4109678292,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc709LbU","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121642","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121642.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121642.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121642","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121642/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121642/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121642/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d21670318fab526f0f651ebbe16e88363143ff07","number":121642,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix  GDExtension interface type mismatch between source file and json file about script instance.","user":{"login":"Daylily-Zeleen","id":61624558,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNjI0NTU4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61624558?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daylily-Zeleen","html_url":"https://github.com/Daylily-Zeleen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daylily-Zeleen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daylily-Zeleen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daylily-Zeleen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daylily-Zeleen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daylily-Zeleen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daylily-Zeleen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daylily-Zeleen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daylily-Zeleen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daylily-Zeleen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fix  GDExtension interface type mismatch between source file and json file about script instance. file and declaration json file about `object_get_script_instance` and `object_set_script_instance`.\r\n\r\nIn GDExtension interface, both `GDExtensionScriptInstanceDataPtr` and `GDExtensionScriptInstancePtr` are `void *`. But the first is a custom data which from GDExtension, the later one is `ScriptInstanceExtension *` which created by godot.\r\n\r\nBefore this pr:\r\n1. The return type of `gdextension_object_get_script_instance()` is `GDExtensionScriptInstancePtr`, but actually return `GDExtensionScriptInstanceDataPtr`.\r\n2. The argument type of `gdextension_object_set_script_instance()` is `GDExtensionScriptInstancePtr`, but it is described as `GDExtensionScriptInstanceDataPtr` in \"gdextension_interface.json\".\r\n\r\nNow:\r\n1. `gdextension_object_get_script_instance()` is return `GDExtensionScriptInstanceDataPtr`.\r\n2. `object_set_script_instance()` is argument type in \"gdextension_interface.json\" is fixed to `GDExtensionScriptInstancePtr`.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nJust fix type mismatch to avoid confusing.\r\n\r\nTo be honest, I had stubbed by this question for a long time until I decided to research the implementation about `object_set_script_instance()` in Godot.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\n1. This pr is not change any implementation, is should not break any compatibility.\r\n2. I found the old commit for old implementation about \"gdextension_interface.h\", is use the correct type (`GDExtensionScriptInstancePtr` for `object_set_script_instance()`).","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":580537003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy